| Discussion | About | State |
|---|---|---|
| [SLH-D-0001-2026-11-23](SLH-D-0001-2026-11-23/consolidation.hmd) | The rudimentary method: the workers' reports and the consolidation | closed |
| [SLH-D-0002-2026-11-23](SLH-D-0002-2026-11-23/consolidation.hmd) | The rename of the documents to the SLH nomenclature | closed |
| [SLH-D-0003-2026-11-23](SLH-D-0003-2026-11-23/alice.hmd) | The pull request for the branch `feat/rudimentary` | open |

A closed discussion is linked to its consolidation, and an open one to the
observer's file.
